    "description": "<div class=\"powr-chat\" id=\"fa409859_1652894558\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>SLEEPY TIME mineral soak: relax your body and mind with pure lavender essential oil and Pacific sea salts. </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>1lb 2oz / 510 g </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>Ingredients: Pacific Sea Salt, Lavandin Hybrida Grosso (Lavender) Essential Oil, Glycerin (Vegetable Glycerin), Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Juice, Ultramarine Violet (Colorant). </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>Add 1-2 large handfuls to a warm bath and soak for 20 minutes.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>",
